title: After You
id: latch
tab: Latch · After You
about: Cue calls places. Latch opens the old talkback line and interrupts the silence.
lead: pip
double: clank 2 -12
key: F mixolydian
bpm: 104
backing:
bass: none
stage: pip, scribe, clank
finale: "Click" on 0

[places]
scribe: "Places please" = 2 4 2/6 | I 4, I 4
pip: "Just one foot on the talkback switch" = 0 2 4 2 0 1 3 2 | I 4, IV 4
scribe: "Wait till I finish what I say" = 4 4 5 6 5 4 3 2 | IV 4, V 4
pip: "I can wait all day" = 2 1 2 1 0/4 | V 4, I 4

[after you]
pip: "After you no after you" = 0/.5 2/.5 4 5/2 4/.5 3/.5 2/3 | I 4, IV 4
scribe: "I have a little song for you" = 2 3 4/.5 5/.5 4 2 3 4/2 | IV 4, I 4
pip: "After you I mean it too" = 0/.5 2/.5 4 5/2 4/.5 3/.5 2/3 | I 4, IV 4
scribe: "Then leave a little room for me" = 4 4 3/.5 2/.5 3 4 2 0/2 | V 4, I 4

[the cut]
scribe: "And now for a surprise" = 2/.5 3/.5 4/.5 3/.5 5/.5 4/1.5 | V 4
pip: "A sur" = 0/.75 2/.75 | I 1.5
rest 2.5
scribe: "You shut the line" = 4 3 2 0 | IV 4
pip: "I thought that was my cue" = 2/.5 2/.5 4/.5 4/.5 2 0 | I 4
rest 4
scribe: "This time wait" = 2 1 0/2 | V 4

[one real turn]
scribe: "The desk came back" = 2 3 4 5/5 | IV 4, I 4
pip: "It went for a walk without me" = 0 1 2 3 4/.5 5/.5 3 2/2 | IV 4, V 4
scribe: "I saved you a place right here" = 2 4 5 4 3 2 0/2 | IV 4, I 4
pip: "After you and thank you too" = 0/.5 2/.5 4 5/2 4/.5 3/.5 0/3 | V 4, I 4
